  "description": "<p>This bug can be seen when attempting to create and view version in the HTML UI.</p>\n\n<ul class=\"alternate\" type=\"square\">\n\t<li>Start Fedora</li>\n\t<li>Create a new resource (/rest/new)</li>\n\t<li>In the new resource, click the button: \"Create Version\"\n\t<ul>\n\t\t<li>Notice the UI is redirected to a page with text: \"No versions have been created for this resource.\"</li>\n\t</ul>\n\t</li>\n\t<li>Go back to new resource, and click the button: \"View Versions\"\n\t<ul>\n\t\t<li>Notice the UI is redirected to a page with text: \"No versions have been created for this resource.\"</li>\n\t</ul>\n\t</li>\n\t<li>From command line, observe that version was actually created:\n\t<ul>\n\t\t<li>curl -i <a href=\"http://localhost:8080/rest/new/fcr:versions\" class=\"external-link\" rel=\"nofollow noreferrer\">http://localhost:8080/rest/new/fcr:versions</a></li>\n\t</ul>\n\t</li>\n</ul>\n",
